Subject: A website for Manama Primary School, a primary school in Zimbabwe.

Description: The site will be a three-page information site for students, parents, and the community. The Home page will present the school's motto, purpose, and latest announcements. The Academics page will cover the curriculum, extra-curricular activities, classes and class teachers, staff, and previous years' results. The third page, will for paying school fees.

Reason: I am a teacher and understand how a school runs. Most schools in Zimbabwe do not have websites, so a site like this would help parents and the community find reliable information about the school.
